group of consumers sharing work
one logical subscriber
Offset:

position in the topic
allows replay
Queue:

FIFO list of messages
one message → one consumer
Exchange (RabbitMQ):

routes messages to queues
Routing key:

routing rule (e.g. order.eu)
DLQ (Dead Letter Queue):

stores failed messages
Producer:

sends messages
Consumer:

processes messages
